From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the ASUS ProArt PZ14 (HT7407NA)

The ASUS ProArt PZ14 (HT7407NA) is a 14 inch tablet with a detachable
keyboard cover, built on the Snapdragon X2 Elite X2E-88-100. Add its
compatible to the Glymur boards.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index a70bc3f..d9b3974 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -87,6 +87,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - anduril,bluechip
+              - asus,proart-pz14-ht7407na
               - asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407na
               - asus,zenbook-a16-ux3607oa
               - hp,elitebook-x-g2q
